OL,3,AWoman, 21, dies in crash following
OL,4,Apolice pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old woman has died in a crash
OL,7,Ffollowing a police pursuit in
OL,8,FStaffordshire.
OL,10,FThe front-seat passenger of a Seat
OL,11,FIbiza, which had been followed by
OL,12,Fofficers, died at the scene of the
OL,13,Fcrash in Rugeley Road, Hednesford, just
OL,14,Fafter 23:00 GMT on Friday,
OL,15,FStaffordshire Police said.
OL,17,FThe force said the Seat collided with
OL,18,Fan Vauxhall Astra, which was also being
OL,19,Fdriven by members of the public, after
OL,20,Fthe "short police pursuit".
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
