OL,3,AWoman, 21, dies in crash following
OL,4,Apolice pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old man from the Walsall area
OL,7,Fwas arrested on suspicion of causing
OL,8,Fdeath by dangerous driving. The force
OL,9,Fsaid the Astra driver was helping with
OL,10,Fpolice inquiries.
